-    *   $\alpha_i \in \mathbb{R}$: Opacity.
-    *   $w_{i,j} \in \mathbb{R}$: Skinning weight for bone $j$ (sums to 1).
-    *   MLP Weights $W_{color}$: Parameters for the shallow color network.
-*   **SMPL Model:** Pre-loaded mesh topology and joint hierarchy.
